<title>USA: Metropane plans debt/equity conversion.</title>
<headline>Metropane plans debt/equity conversion.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropane Inc said Thursday it was launching a program under which noteholders and creditors may convert company debt into equity.</p>
<p>David Melina, president and chief executive officer, said the program was crucial in stablizing the company's balance sheet and solidifying its financial footing.</p>
<p>The company said it has scheduled a meeting for April 17 to discuss the program.</p>
</text>
